0:08:55.00 --> 0:09:15.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: A character's eye pops out. Others play with the eyeball.)

0:28:40.84 --> 0:28:41.74
profane word 2 (oh god)

0:30:40.00 --> 0:31:00.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: We see Hercules training. He does an obstacle course with knives, blades and sharks.)

0:32:40.00 --> 0:34:30.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: Hercules fights a centaur. He punches, charges, slam on rock, and in the end knocks the creature out.)

0:37:54.85 --> 0:37:56.99
profane word 2 (oh my god)

0:44:20.00 --> 0:48:30.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: Hercules fights a dragon. The dragon swallows him whole - but Hercules cuts the dragon open from the inside and escapes. The dragon drops dead. He then decapitates more dragons. The others corner him - but he emerges victorious.)

0:58:20.00 --> 0:58:45.00
sex 1 (SceneRadar: A woman attempts to seduce Hercules.)

1:00:00.00 --> 1:00:10.00
sex 1 (SceneRadar: The couple almost kiss.)

1:10:45.00 --> 1:11:30.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: Monsters emerge out of earth.)

1:12:20.00 --> 1:18:50.00
violence 1 (SceneRadar: A city is under attack - the residents flee in panic. The monsters destroy buildings, roads and statues. Zeus is struck by lightning. Hercules is badly beaten up by the monsters. Hercules attacks the monsters eye and shoves it down a cliff. A woman is trapped under a pillar. Hercules - with Zeus' help - defeats the monsters.)

1:19:00.00 --> 1:20:00.00
violence 2 (SceneRadar: A monster attacks and kills a woman. Hercules is able to revive her to life.)

1:25:35.00 --> 1:25:45.00
sex 1 (SceneRadar: A couple kiss.)
